>Quite some time ago I've heard that covetous monsters
>would occasionally steal those artifacts instead of
>your quest artifact which you want keep using.

A cursory look suggests that stealamulet() in steal.c takes care of this;
the order of priority is Amulet, Quest Artifact, Bell, Book, Candle.
Covetous monsters other than the wizard will steal fake amulets as well as
real ones, so they are useful for padding the quest artifact, but the
Invocation items are not.

I haven't really checked there isn't any other factor, though.
